## Model card

- **Name:** Qoder Sonus
- **Short description:** Qoder built-in model announced 2026, positioned for marathon-length autonomous tasks, computer use, knowledge work and coding. Described as best when using the computer with Qoder Desktop improvements.
- **Provider / access:** Qoder platform built-in model, available across Qoder, Qoder IDE, Qoder CLI, JetBrains plugin, QoderWake, Cloud Agents. Credit multiplier 3.2×.
- **Release / knowledge:** Announced 2026; exact release date not publicly documented.
- **IDs:** Sonus / qoder-sonus
- **Context window:** Qoder UI supports 200K, 400K, 1M options per docs; specific Sonus default not published.
- **Modalities:** Text input/output; computer use tooling integration; no independent multimodal spec published.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-04):** Credit-based metering via Qoder plans; no direct per-token pricing published. Credit multiplier 3.2× for Sonus.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary; underlying vendor/model not disclosed.

